hub.com/MilesRomanum","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilesRomanum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilesRomanum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilesRomanum/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilesRomanum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilesRomanum/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilesRomanum/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilesRomanum/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilesRomanum/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MilesRomanum/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-26T07:54:54Z","updated_at":"2024-11-26T07:54:54Z","body":"Also, what other owners exist? I looked over the code and at a glance I only see ThemeOwner and RidOwners.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2499909048/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737302019","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99307#issuecomment-2737302019","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99307","id":2737302019,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jJ-oD","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T16:28:47Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T16:29:00Z","body":"After analyzing a bunch of related bug reports, I think the only RID owners that actually need configurability are these:\r\n- `RID_Owner<Instance, true> instance_owner;` <- I.e., `Node3D`\r\n- `RID_Owner<Item, true> canvas_item_owner;` <- I,.e., `Node2D`\r\n\r\n`RID_Owner` and `RID_Alloc` templates could be extended with another `bool` template argument like `bool CONFIGURABLE`, and the setting would only be honored for those with `true`.\r\n\r\nThat way, the setting name and its explanation also becomes much less abstract.\r\n\r\nAside, for owners with `CONFIGURABLE` being `true`, it'd be nice to make a mention to the setting in the message errors (`Element limit for RID of type '%s' reached.` and `Element limit reached.`);","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737302019/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3287903486","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99307#issuecomment-3287903486","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99307","id":3287903486,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7D-Wz-","user":{"login":"MatthiasBae","id":52577744,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNTc3NzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubus